# Signing material — EAS manages credentials remotely (implementation plan
# docs/specs/developments/20260802155158_23-eas-build-release-ci Decision D12). Nothing
# signable belongs in this repository; these patterns exist so a downloaded key or keystore
# cannot be committed by accident.
credentials.json
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
*.jks

